        <head>UP-TO-DATE LADY THIEF. Paris Shoplifter s Novel Use for Harem</head>
        <p>UP-TO-DATE LADY THIEF. Paris Shoplifter s Novel Use for Harem</p>
        <p>Skirt.</p>
        <p>PARIS, Wednesday. At one of the largest 'boy. On the left side of the river this morning the attention of an inspector was drawn to a lady visitor wearing a harem skirt beeeeth big for coat_ The inspector was ansnsing himself by looking at the drowse, although be could see but little of it, when he noticed the wearer steal a piece of lace. She was followed on leaving the shop, and ted, and in spite of her proteets was taken to the commissary of police. Fiore It was found that she was wearing a reel harem shirt of very ample dimensions, which contained a quantity of lace sad other costly article, which she had stoles.</p>
        <p>Taut op-to-date thief is s young woman of 22, living in the Avenue du Maine. Sbe was taken to the police depot.</p>
      </div>
